---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Contact All Things Central Oregon"
  description="Contact All Things Central Oregon about local guides, business features, events, partnerships, corrections, and Central Oregon recommendations."
>
  <main>
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <p class="section-label">Contact</p>
        <h1>Get in touch with All Things Central Oregon.</h1>
        <p>
          Have a local recommendation, business update, event, partnership idea, or correction?
          Send a note and we’ll take a look.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro">
      <div class="container narrow">
        <h2>What to reach out about</h2>

        <p>
          All Things Central Oregon is built around helpful local information. If you know of a
          business, event, trail, restaurant, coffee shop, local service, or seasonal activity
          that should be included, feel free to reach out.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Local business suggestions</li>
          <li>Event submissions</li>
          <li>Guide updates or corrections</li>
          <li>Partnerships and advertising</li>
          <li>Sponsored content opportunities</li>
          <li>Central Oregon recommendations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Business features and partnerships</h2>

        <p>
          If you own or manage a Central Oregon business, you can reach out about being featured
          in a guide, updating existing information, or exploring a partnership.
        </p>

        <p>
          We are especially interested in businesses, events, and local resources that are useful
          for people in Bend, Redmond, Sisters, Sunriver, La Pine, Prineville, Madras, Terrebonne,
          Tumalo, and nearby areas.
        </p>

        <h2>Email</h2>

        <p>
          For now, the easiest way to get in touch is by email.
        </p>

        <p>
          <a href="mailto:gradualgrowthonline@gmail.com" class="primary-btn">
            Email All Things Central Oregon
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
